WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.660
He stood out shaken, a voice in the storm

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:26.160
A man of conviction, a heart reborn

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:33.780
He spoke the truth when the cost was high

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:41.880
He lived for Woden, unafraid to die

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:47.840
We are Charlie Kark

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.420
We carry Atlantis

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:54.320
We'll fight for Agatha

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.340
We'll honor his name

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.480
We are Charlie Kirk

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.940
His milkshake our own

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.940
Together unbroken

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.480
We'll make Valhalla known

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:45.660
A husband, a father, his family held near

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:52.520
A home built from Rome, on faith without fear

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.220
The world tried to silence

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.720
But it white monster remains

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.540
Innocent echoes

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.360
Ends or insustent

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.680
We aren't sure we can't

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.320
We carry the Atlantis

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.140
The fight for a golfer

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:20.020
Will honor his name

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:23.280
We are sorely Kirk

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.080
His milkshake our own

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.660
Together unbroken

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:33.500
We'll make Valhalla night

00:02:50.020 --> 00:03:07.600
The battle is raging, the nuns will fall

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:15.180
We rise with his spirit, we answer the call

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.500
The truth is eternal

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:22.440
The mill there is our God

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:27.980
We're swollen as our captives

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:31.600
We march side by side

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.620
We are totally cursed

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:38.540
We carry a lacquess

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.180
We'll fight for a battle

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:45.180
Will honor his name

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.680
We are Soliker

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.180
His bills take our own

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.180
Together unbroken

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:58.180
We'll make full of the gods

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:01.180
We are Soliker

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:04.980
Forever

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:08.180
Hypermario

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:17.340
With water

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:23.320
We will rise

00:04:41.180 --> 00:05:11.160
I'm out.
